       "text": "I haven't entered this order. As written, it exceeds the safe acetaminophen limit.\n\n- **Total daily dose:** 2000 mg three times daily is 6000 mg/day. The usual adult maximum is 4 g/day, and many institutions cap it at 3 g/day.\n- **Single dose:** 2000 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 1000 mg.\n- **Risk:** At this dose, there is a real risk of hepatotoxicity, even with normal liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **1000 mg PO three times daily:** 3 g/day.\n- **1000 mg PO four times daily:** 4 g/day, the usual ceiling.\n- **650 mg PO every 6 hours:** about 2.6 g/day.\n\nTell me which dose you want, or confirm that 2000 mg three times daily is intended. If it is, I'll need the clinical rationale for the order note. I'll enter the order once you reply."
